DIVVY — LOGO ASSETS
===================

Brand colors
------------
Blue (primary):   #2C74C6
Charcoal (dark):  #242C2F
White:            #FFFFFF

Typeface: geometric neo-grotesque (Liberation Sans Bold, Arial/Helvetica-metric).
All text in these files is converted to vector outlines — no fonts required to view or render.

Files
-----
svg/   Scalable vectors (use these everywhere you can — web, print, scaling)
  divvy-wordmark-blue.svg        div/vy wordmark, blue, transparent bg
  divvy-wordmark-white.svg       div/vy wordmark, white (for dark backgrounds)
  divvy-icon-blue.svg            App icon — blue rounded square, white slash
  divvy-icon-outline-dark.svg    App icon — outlined, for dark backgrounds
  divvy-lockup-blue.svg          Wordmark + "Split the bill. Settle in USDC."
  divvy-lockup-white.svg         Same lockup, white

png/   High-resolution raster (transparent backgrounds)
  divvy-wordmark-blue.png / -white.png      ~2400px wide
  divvy-lockup-blue.png / -white.png        ~2400px wide
  divvy-icon-blue-1024.png
  divvy-icon-outline-dark-1024.png

favicon/  Web + app icons (square, transparent)
  favicon.ico              multi-size (16/32/48) — drop in site root
  icon-16/32/48/192/512.png
  apple-touch-icon.png     180px (iOS home screen)

Favicon HTML (paste into <head>)
--------------------------------
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon/icon-32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/favicon/icon-192.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png">

Need other sizes, an SVG favicon, or the slash angle tweaked? Just ask.
